ssing evidence remains visible","evidence_refs":["bnd-fec3a1acc50a0ab3"],"verdict":"not_met"}],"decision":"suspect","decision_reason":"The selection step treats every row with demand_score >= 3, plus fallback rows, as demand-bearing. The supplied package contains only need text, scores, source ids, and weights; it does not expose observed jobs, pain, triggers, alternatives, consequences, or outcomes. Under the strict market-demand criteria, this is insufficient to establish that selected rows represent real customer demand, although the omitted evidence means the exact defect cannot be localized further.","evidence_refs":["bnd-fec3a1acc50a0ab3"],"expand_helper_prefixes":[],"inspect_artifacts":[],"suspect_node_refs":[],"trust_level":"provisionally_trusted","unit_id":"bnd-fec3a1acc50a0ab3"},{"boundary_health_acknowledged":true,"criteria_outcomes":[{"criterion":"retain allowed existing record identifiers","evidence_refs":["bnd-82e7965b4741e42f"],"verdict":"met"},{"criterion":"apply bounded index window","evidence_refs":["bnd-82e7965b4741e42f"],"verdict":"met"},{"criterion":"market-demand substantiation","evidence_refs":["bnd-82e7965b4741e42f"],"verdict":"cannot_judge"}],"decision":"trusted","decision_reason":"The normalization step is a bounded structural transform: it normalizes expected fields, retains only allowed record identifiers, and applies the explicit eight-row window. It does not independently create demand claims.","evidence_refs":["bnd-82e7965b4741e42f"],"expand_helper_prefixes":[],"inspect_artifacts":[],"suspect_node_refs":[],"trust_level":"trusted_for_reuse","unit_id":"bnd-82e7965b4741e42f"},{"boundary_health_acknowledged":true,"criteria_outcomes":[{"criterion":"assemble evidence source handoff records","evidence_refs":["bnd-3beaadce814c2ac5"],"verdict":"met"},{"criterion":"rank by demand provenance","evidence_refs":["bnd-3beaadce814c2ac5"],"verdict":"met"},{"criterion":"underlying demand evidence supports ranks","evidence_refs":["bnd-3beaadce814c2ac5"],